baseline.what_exists:
BackupController.toSummaryBody returns exactly these keys: artefact_id, device_id, collected_at, size_bytes, digest_prefix, validation_level, deviation_state. deviation_state is null or one of unchanged, changed, first -- a CHECK constraint in migration V18 enforces the three.

BackupPanel renders the state like this:

              {b.deviation_state === null ? (
                <StatusChip tone="neutral" label="not evaluated" dense />
              ) : (
                <StatusChip tone="neutral" label={b.deviation_state} dense />
              )}

Every deviation value is deliberately neutral in tone: a changed configuration is evidence, not a fault, and none of the four may be styled as an alarm.
